@startuml
title MVP resource contention — local guards, separate system stores
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 180
rectangle "Core concurrent commands\nPublish / application / private file admission" as C
database "Core local transaction guards\nVersions / quota / protected references" as D
folder "Core private bytes / temporary processing\nSame Resumefolio server" as F
rectangle "Actual CPU / memory / disk workload\nMeasure capacity and limit contention" as R
C --> D : core-local ordering
C --> F : safe bounded storage work
C ..> R
package "Separate ProjectForge" {
 rectangle "Repository / issue / board operations" as G
 database "Independent native refs / owned data" as GD
 G --> GD : own guards; no core transaction
}
C <--> G : user-scoped API; no SQL lock held over request
G ..> R : only actual measured co-placement if later selected
note bottom of R
 Physical ProjectForge placement is undecided.
 Never assume shared database atomicity across systems.
end note
@enduml
